SUMMARY:D10 | Himeji Castle and the bullet trains\, then Osaka Castle and S
 hinsekai | 7 to 11 °C
LOCATION:Hotel Links Namba
DESCRIPTION:Weather: Osaka 7 to 11 °C\, partly cloudy (0%).\nWear: Warm ja
 cket with a layer underneath. Forecast checked 25 Nov\, 05:38\nMeals: Brea
 kfast\nMorning: Revised today: breakfast ran late\, so leave the hotel at 
 08:00 for the lion\, then Himeji. Out all day\, back tonight.\nLenses: 24-
 70\, 70-200 and 2x\nHotel tonight: Hotel Links Namba\, 1-9-27 Inari\, Nani
 wa-ku\, Osaka 556-0023\nCamera Carry: 24-70\, 70-200 and 2x.\nCamera Leave
  at the hotel: 12-24\, IT32\, tripod\nRevised 25 Nov\, 08:00: breakfast ra
 n late. Lion at 08:05\, train at 08:20\, Himeji Castle 09:50 to 11:30. Eve
 rything from 11:30 is unchanged.\nYou won't be back at the hotel until ton
 ight. Carry passport\, IC card\, 24-70\, 70-200\, 2x\, spare batteries\, p
 ower bank\, phone cable\, warm jacket\, and a bag with room for the shoe b
 ox and clip.\nIf you're behind at Himeji\, skip the inside of the keep. Th
 e 12:45 Shinkansen matters more.\nHiking shoes at Ishii Sports\, Umeda\, 1
 3:30 to 14:05. Break them in on Days 11 and 12 before Mt Misen.\nPeak Desi
 gn Capture clip at Yodobashi Camera Umeda\, 14:05 to 14:30\, same building
  as the shoes.\nBe at Morinomiya Station by 15:00 for the group. Check Daa
 n's Day 10 message tonight for any change.\nIC card needs 1\,880 yen for y
 our own fares (Namba to Umeda 240\, Osaka to Himeji 1\,460\, Osaka to Mori
 nomiya 180). You had 164 yen\, so add 2\,000 yen at Namba before the 08:20
  train. Group transfers are paid by the tour company.\nCosts: 1\,700 yen o
 ut\, about 3\,220 yen back (unreserved Shinkansen ticket to Osaka)\, 2\,50
 0 yen castle. Roughly 7\,420 yen in total\, plus the shoes and clip.
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
