BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:japan2026-20261125-himeji-castle-outside-views-only@akumarau
DTSTAMP:20261127T043242Z
SEQUENCE:38252
DTSTART;TZID=Asia/Tokyo:20261125T101500
DTEND;TZID=Asia/Tokyo:20261125T113000
SUMMARY:Himeji Castle\, outside views only
LOCATION:Himeji Castle\, 68 Honmachi\, Himeji\, Hyogo 670-0012
DESCRIPTION:Google Maps: https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Hi
 meji%20Castle%2C%2068%20Honmachi%2C%20Himeji%2C%20Hyogo%20670-0012\nRunnin
 g about an hour late\, so skip the 2\,500 yen ticket. Shoot the keep up Ot
 emae Street with the 70-200\, then the Sannomaru lawn and gates with the 2
 4-70. These areas are free.\nLeave the castle by 11:15 for the 11:45 platf
 orm photos.\nEntry 2\,500 yen for visitors since March 2026. Open 09:00\, 
 last entry 16:00. Shoes off inside the keep.\nWalk up Otemae Street from t
 he station\, about 15 min\, with the keep straight ahead.\nConfirmed by Hi
 meji City: repair scaffolding stands around the keep\, at the Ni no Yagura
 \, Mizu no Nimon and Bizen Maru\, from July 2026 to about July 2027. The k
 eep itself is not wrapped\, but views and the walking route are affected.\
 nLook from the Sannomaru lawn first. If the scaffolding spoils the shot\, 
 skip the 2\,500 yen ticket and keep the Shinkansen photos. Leave by 11:30.
  If you're behind\, skip the inside of the keep.
URL:https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Himeji%20Castle%2C%2068
 %20Honmachi%2C%20Himeji%2C%20Hyogo%20670-0012
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:japan2026-20261125-shinkansen-photos-at-himeji-station@akumarau
DTSTAMP:20261127T043242Z
SEQUENCE:38252
DTSTART;TZID=Asia/Tokyo:20261125T114500
DTEND;TZID=Asia/Tokyo:20261125T124500
SUMMARY:Shinkansen photos at Himeji Station
LOCATION:JR Himeji Station\, Himeji\, Hyogo
DESCRIPTION:Google Maps: https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=JR
 %20Himeji%20Station%2C%20Himeji%2C%20Hyogo\nBuy an unreserved Shinkansen t
 icket to Osaka\, not Shin-Osaka (about 3\,220 yen: 1\,460 yen fare plus 1\
 ,760 yen unreserved express fee). It gets you onto the Shinkansen platform
 s and covers the JR hop from Shin-Osaka to Osaka.\nNozomi trains run throu
 gh the middle tracks without stopping\, between platforms 11 and 12. Stopp
 ing trains pull in on either side.\nStay behind the yellow line\, no flash
 \, and keep the bag out of the walkway. Grab an ekiben for the ride.
URL:https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=JR%20Himeji%20Station%2
 C%20Himeji%2C%20Hyogo
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
