SUMMARY:JR Shin-Osaka to Osaka Station
LOCATION:JR Osaka Station\, Kita Ward\, Osaka
DESCRIPTION:Google Maps: https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=JR
 %20Osaka%20Station%2C%20Kita%20Ward%2C%20Osaka\nYour ticket is made out to
  Osaka\, so it covers this hop. Use the transfer gates and keep the ticket
 \, then feed it through the exit gate at Osaka. No IC tap needed. JR Kyoto
  Line\, one stop\, about 4 min. Eat the ekiben on the Shinkansen\, so no l
 unch stop is needed.
