UID:japan2026-20261125-hiking-shoes-ishii-sports-links-umeda@akumarau
DTSTAMP:20261127T043242Z
SEQUENCE:38252
DTSTART;TZID=Asia/Tokyo:20261125T133000
DTEND;TZID=Asia/Tokyo:20261125T140500
SUMMARY:Hiking shoes: Ishii Sports Links Umeda
LOCATION:Ishii Sports Links Umeda\, Yodobashi Umeda Tower 6F\, 1-1 Ofukacho
 \, Kita Ward\, Osaka
DESCRIPTION:Google Maps: https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Is
 hii%20Sports%20Links%20Umeda%2C%20Yodobashi%20Umeda%20Tower%206F%2C%201-1%
 20Ofukacho%2C%20Kita%20Ward%2C%20Osaka\nMountain specialist\, open 10:00 t
 o 21:00. Linked underground to JR Osaka Station. Phone 06-6136-8512.\nYour
  shortlist from the earlier shoe chat: Lowa Innox Pro GTX Lo or Salomon X 
 Ultra 5 GTX\, size 26 cm. Mainly for Blue Mountains bushwalks at home\, an
 d useful on Misen and Fudekage. Try 26.5 cm too.\nSizes are in cm. Ask sta
 ff to measure both feet and try them on with hiking socks. Walk around the
  shop\, including any stairs or slope\, before you pay.\nTax refund: from 
 1 Nov 2026 you pay the full price\, then claim the 10% back at departure. 
 Show your passport at the till. Spend 5\,000 yen or more before tax in one
  store on one day. Keep the receipt and wear the shoes home.\nAlpen OSAKA\
 , 4F Alpen Outdoors: Chayamachi\, about 5 min walk. 10:00 to 21:00. Trekki
 ng shoes and a foot scanner.\nmont-bell Kyoto Ekimae\, Day 8: AEON Mall KY
 OTO Sakura 3F\, 5 min from the Hachijo exit. 10:00 to 21:00. Use it if you
 r shoes fail before Day 10.\nKojitsu Sanso Hiroshima Kamiyacho\, Day 12: L
 ast chance. Weekdays 11:00 to 20:00\, near the hotel.
URL:https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Ishii%20Sports%20Links%
 20Umeda%2C%20Yodobashi%20Umeda%20Tower%206F%2C%201-1%20Ofukacho%2C%20Kita%
 20Ward%2C%20Osaka
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
