BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:japan2026-20261127-soft-suitcase-good-brand-sogo-hiroshima-@akumarau
DTSTAMP:20261127T043242Z
SEQUENCE:38252
DTSTART;TZID=Asia/Tokyo:20261127T181500
DTEND;TZID=Asia/Tokyo:20261127T190000
SUMMARY:Soft suitcase\, good brand: Sogo Hiroshima travel goods (optional)
LOCATION:Sogo Hiroshima\, 6-27 Motomachi\, Naka Ward\, Hiroshima
DESCRIPTION:Google Maps: https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=So
 go%20Hiroshima%2C%206-27%20Motomachi%2C%20Naka%20Ward%2C%20Hiroshima\nDepa
 rtment store at Kamiyacho\, a short walk from the hotel and the Peace Park
 . Open 10:00 to 19:30. Ask for the travel goods floor: “Ryokō yōhin ur
 iba wa doko desu ka?” Use this slot if the shoes were bought on Day 10. 
 Buy or just window shop.\nLook for soft cases from Samsonite\, TUMI\, Brig
 gs & Riley or ACE. Check: ballistic or high denier nylon\, YKK zips\, four
  spinner wheels\, an expansion zip\, and a warranty that is honoured in Au
 stralia.\nSize: the PD 45L (56 x 33 x 24 cm) goes inside. Choose about 70 
 to 75 cm tall\, roughly 80 to 100 litres. Compress the pack to 35L first a
 nd take it to test the fit.\nCamera body\, lenses and all batteries stay i
 n the cabin. Spare lithium batteries are not allowed in checked bags. Chec
 k your checked bag allowance in the Qantas app. Tax refund: passport at th
 e till\, keep the receipt.\nBackup: Fukuya Hatchobori or Hiroshima Mitsuko
 shi\, both near Hatchobori. On 29 Nov after the tour ends at 09:00\, Fukuy
 a Hiroshima Ekimae and Bic Camera at the station\, before the train to Mih
 ara.
URL:https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Sogo%20Hiroshima%2C%206
 -27%20Motomachi%2C%20Naka%20Ward%2C%20Hiroshima
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
