DTEND;TZID=Asia/Tokyo:20261128T182500
SUMMARY:Ferry and JR train back to Hiroshima
LOCATION:Miyajima Pier\, Miyajimacho\, Hatsukaichi\, Hiroshima
DESCRIPTION:Google Maps: https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Mi
 yajima%20Pier%2C%20Miyajimacho%2C%20Hatsukaichi%2C%20Hiroshima\nFastest wa
 y back: ferry to Miyajimaguchi\, then the JR Sanyo Line to Hiroshima. The 
 streetcar is covered by the guide's card but takes over an hour.\nAsk the 
 guide whether the card covers the JR ferry. The JR train goes on your IC c
